<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss April car registrations rise 12.0 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Swiss April car registrations rise 12.0 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in Switzerland and Liechtenstein rose 12.0 percent in April from a year earlier to 32,784 vehicles. There was a cumulative 2.9 percent decline to 95,712 in the first four months of the year, the Swiss Car Importers Association said.</p>
<p> Leading exporters	     April 1997    April 1996</p>
<p>    Germany			 14,058	   12,874</p>
<p>    France			   5,195	   4,193</p>
<p>    Italy			    2,057	   2,046</p>
<p>    Japan			    7,906	   7,055</p>
<p>    Sweden			   966	     759</p>
<p>    Britain			  452	     311</p>
<p>    Korea			    718	     595</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom 41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
